<title>UK: Boots to pay staff 34 mln stg bonus - report.</title>
<headline>Boots to pay staff 34 mln stg bonus - report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>British pharmacy and retailer Boots Co Plc is planning to pay its 50,000 staff tax-free bonuses averaging 680 stg each, the Independent newspaper said.</p>
<p>In its Monday edition, the newspaper said the payout from the company's staff bonus pool would total 34 million stg.</p>
<p>Boots said recently it would hand back around 400 million stg to shareholders after annual profits rose by 8.7 percent.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
